  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I would like to be able to manage the PC and Quest versions of a world separately. Ideally even to keep the Quest version private while the PC is public.\nI realize you can upload as a separate ID until you are happy, but it would be easier to just be able to manage them individually.\nUntil that is available, anyone know how I can delete the Quest version of my world without deleting both and re-uploading the PC version as a new world? I really don't want to wait for it to become public again just because I messed up and uploaded a Quest version that I am not ready to maintain yet.",
